 "summary": "Armstrong's Design Envelope in-line pumps carry an integrated drive and pump controller that speaks Modbus RTU on RS-485 or Modbus TCP over Ethernet. The register map gives speed, voltage, run status and I/O, the engineering units in use, control mode, hand/off/auto, speed limits, a BMS speed command and start/stop. Power, flow, head, current, counters and alarm words are 32-bit in the manual and are left out here because their word order is not documented.",
